    "detailed_description": "Nanokeeper is a short roguelite that blends strategy, action, and chaos in a minimalist battlefield. <strong>Your towers are your last line of defense, but don\u2019t worry \u2013 they know how to fight back</strong>, while you focus on making strategic decisions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Automatic Shooting</strong>: Towers fire and position themselves automatically, letting you focus on strategies and upgrades.<br></li><li><strong>Collect and Upgrade</strong>: Defeat enemies to collect Nanos, the experience currency used to unlock improvements in a persistent skill tree.<br></li><li><strong>Roguelite Progression</strong>: Every run is an opportunity to explore unique combinations of towers and upgrades, while the skill tree ensures you come back stronger each time.<br></li><li><strong>Strategic Choices</strong>: At the end of each wave, select a temporary upgrade that can shift the course of the match.</li></ul>Nanokeeper is an arcade shooter where the focus isn\u2019t on protecting something \u2013 the towers are fighting to defend themselves. Add, attack, and conquer the arena in a game that uniquely blends chaos with control.",
